cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use StrataSLAM, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "StrataSLAM: open multi-floor 3D SLAM for ROS 2"
version: 0.2.0
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - family-names: Guerrero Hernández
    given-names: José Miguel
    email: josemiguel.guerrero@urjc.es
    affiliation: "Universidad Rey Juan Carlos"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2521-514X"
abstract: >-
  Open multi-floor 3D SLAM for ROS 2 that keeps one point cloud per floor and a
  global one, detects and classifies floor transitions and fuses the floors
  offline. This work is part of the project AURORAS (PID2024-161761OB-C22),
  funded by MICIU/AEI/10.13039/501100011033.
keywords:
  - SLAM
  - multi-floor mapping
  - ROS 2
  - mobile robots
date-released: 2026-11-02
repository-code: "https://github.com/EasyNavigation/StrataSLAM"
